trait-category-addictions = Addictions

trait-requirement-species-cannot-absorb = Your character must be a species that [color=yellow]can absorb substances[/color] — one that has a bloodstream, for example.

trait-alcohol-addiction-name = Alcohol addiction
trait-alcohol-addiction-desc = You need alcohol. Five minutes without a drink and the craving sets in, growing stronger and more insistent over time. After 40 minutes of staying clean the addiction goes away on its own, but Antizavin can remove it instantly.

trait-nicotine-addiction-name = Nicotine addiction
trait-nicotine-addiction-desc = You need nicotine. Five minutes without a cigarette and the craving sets in, growing stronger and more insistent over time, and after ten minutes you start coughing. After 40 minutes of staying clean the addiction goes away on its own, but Antizavin can remove it instantly.

trait-narcotics-addiction-name = Narcotics addiction
trait-narcotics-addiction-desc = You need a dose. Five minutes without a drug and the craving sets in, growing stronger and more insistent over time. After 40 minutes of staying clean the addiction goes away on its own, but Antizavin can remove it instantly.
